---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<Base
  title="Credits"
  description="Credits for Backyard Monsters Revamped: the Backyard Monsters Refitted server, the licence, the art and the font."
  current="credits"
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Credits</span>
      <h1>Credits</h1>
      <p>
        <strong>Backyard Monsters Revamped</strong> is a fan-made revamp of Backyard Monsters, built on the Backyard
        Monsters Refitted project.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap page-body">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 id="fan-project">A free fan project</h2>
      <p>Backyard Monsters Revamped is an unofficial, free, non-commercial fan project run by volunteers.</p>
      <p>
        Backyard Monsters was created by <strong>Kixeye</strong>. "Backyard Monsters" and related names, logos and
        artwork belong to Kixeye or their respective owners. This project is
        <strong>not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Kixeye</strong>. It is made to keep the game alive.
      </p>

      <h2 id="server">The game server</h2>
      <p>
        The game server is based on <strong><a href={SITE.refittedUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer">Backyard Monsters Refitted</a></strong>.
        Its team restored the original game and wrote its server. Thank you to them and to all contributors.
      </p>
      <p>
        The source code is used and shared under the
        <strong><a href={SITE.licenceUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer">PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0</a></strong>.
        In short: you may use, change and share the code for non-commercial purposes. The licence covers the code only.
        It does not give you any rights to Kixeye's names, logos or artwork.
      </p>

      <h2 id="client">The web client, art and font</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Web client:</strong> the game you play in your browser was written for Backyard Monsters Revamped. It
          shares the same licence as the server.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Art:</strong> the monsters, buildings and other game art come from the original Backyard Monsters,
          with some new and repainted art made for this project. The painted monster portraits and tribe leaders on
          this website were made for this project with Google Gemini, using the original art as a reference. Bob, the
          guide, is a new character painted the same way.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Font:</strong> <strong>Titan One</strong> by Rodrigo Fuenzalida, used under the
          <a href="https://openfontlicense.org" rel="noopener noreferrer">SIL Open Font License 1.1</a>. The full licence
          text: <a href="/fonts/titan-one/OFL.txt">OFL.txt</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Website:</strong> built with <a href="https://astro.build" rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="support">Support us</h2>
      <p>
        If you enjoy the game, you can
        <strong><a href={SITE.patreonUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer">support us on Patreon</a></strong>. It helps pay for
        the servers. It gives no in-game advantage. <a href="/support/">More about supporting</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
